Spec: Stage

ID:
  @API

Purpose:
  API surface implementation and contract validation.

Owns: stages\API.sdd
Entry:
  backend ready
  contract defined
  applicable skills loaded

Must:
  implement API endpoints
  validate contracts
  add API tests
  document endpoints
  handle auth

Exit:
  endpoints implemented
  contract tests pass
  API docs updated
  security review passed

OnFail:
  << API

Next:
  FE
  MD
  QA

Review:
  @API/contract
  @SC/api-security

Risk:
  R2

Skills:
  @api/rest
  @api/contract
  @api/versioning
  @api/auth

State: +
  
